config.prompt:
You are updating the Signals CRM via its local agent-tools REST API.

Base URL: {{ $signals_base_url }}

1. Read the tool manifest (already fetched in flow variable `signals_tools` if available, otherwise GET /api/agent-tools).
2. Create a contact with create_contact using:
   - name: {{ $contact_name }}
   - company: {{ $contact_company }}
   - platform: {{ $contact_platform }}
3. Enrich the new contact with enrich_contact (fill gaps only) using title {{ $contact_title }} and email {{ $contact_email }}.
4. Verify with get_contact.
5. Reply with a short summary: contact id, fields set, enrichment score, and any follow-up task you recommend.

API contract:
- Manifest: GET {{ $signals_base_url }}/api/agent-tools
- Invoke: POST {{ $signals_base_url }}/api/agent-tools/invoke with JSON body {"tool":"<name>","input":{...}}

Use curl from the shell. The API is localhost-only unless SIGNALS_AGENT_TOOL_TOKEN is configured.
